<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST -Iraq - Oct 7.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST -Iraq - Oct 7.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>QADISSIYA</p>
<p>- Iraq's Culture and Information Minister critcises Turkish officials' statements concerning Iraqi Turkomans.</p>
<p>- Iraqis observe on Monday the assassination attempt in 1959 of the then Iraq's prime minister General Abdul-Karim Qasim.</p>
<p>- Babylon International Festival concludes.</p>
<p>(The above stories were also carried by THAWRA and JUMHOURIYA.)</p>
